      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 7,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "Moses was eighty years old, and Aaron eighty-three years old, when they spoke to Pharaoh.",
      "ko": "그들이 바로에게 말할 때에 모세는 팔십세이었고 아론은 팔십 삼세이었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "a73aed8f4fc8b3da9f43eb0af16bf69aa5fe3df7048189b38bee14dfac2739c2",
      "translation_text_hash": "4930aef06445dc9d33675aea2abfaf4885544f47d56e6c127568d9ae8b585966",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "그들이 바로에게 말할 때에 모세는 팔십세이었고 아론은 팔십 삼세이었더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "4930aef06445dc9d33675aea2abfaf4885544f47d56e6c127568d9ae8b585966"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EXO:7:8",
      "sequence": 1694,
