      "en": "The fish that were in the river died. The river became foul. The Egyptians couldn’t drink water from the river. The blood was throughout all the land of Egypt.",
      "ko": "하수의 고기가 죽고 그 물에서는 악취가 나니 애굽 사람들이 하수 물을 마시지 못하며 애굽 온 땅에는 피가 있으나",
      "source_text_hash": "c252b329cb6b664b16b25d93332ff0c1f27597aa055751878475c2feeaa5f459",
      "translation_text_hash": "6d962242a4f1575a686666abad6e009418989ce961515bae3183152b32fe6785",
