      "en": "The magicians of Egypt did the same thing with their enchantments. So Pharaoh’s heart was hardened, and he didn’t listen to them, as the LORD had spoken.",
      "ko": "애굽 술객들도 자기 술법으로 그와 같이 행하므로 바로의 마음이 강퍅하여 그들을 듣지 아니하니 여호와의 말씀과 같더라",
      "source_text_hash": "f425eda66b900eb8ce564ecc83808f6fb3ce97224d80651efb0ff305af4ac60f",
      "translation_text_hash": "d1f19da142122c178acbdc03091b6e65237ab73a2af57eb5759843b6c57eaecb",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
